{"id":"662898","name":"午餐肉虾仁紫菜炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662898/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾去壳去虾线洗净，改刀切小块。","img":"images/662898/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"午餐肉切小块备用。","img":"images/662898/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"紫菜放入锅中烘至两面变色，取出放保鲜袋里捏碎备用。","img":"images/662898/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡蛋炒散。","img":"images/662898/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入午餐肉翻炒均匀。","img":"images/662898/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入虾仁。","img":"images/662898/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒至虾仁变色。","img":"images/662898/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入米饭。","img":"images/662898/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量盐翻炒均匀。","img":"images/662898/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入紫菜。","img":"images/662898/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/662898/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662898/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662898/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}